{"id": "17-3138-2-2", "zh": "su 等词根类", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3139-2-8", "zh": "su（词根），义为听。语尾的生起与前面一样。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3140-2-8", "zh": "512. 在 su 等词根之后，也有 ṇu、ṇā、uṇā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3141-2-13", "zh": "在为主动语态规定的语尾和后缀之前，su 等这一类词根之后会加上 ṇu、ṇā、uṇā 这些后缀。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3141-14-27", "zh": "根据“aññesu ca”这条规则里的 ca 字，ṇu 后缀要增强（vuddhi）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3141-28-35", "zh": "根据从同一条规则承续下来的 vā 字，su 等词根在 ṇu、ṇā 等后缀之前不增强。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3142-2-8", "zh": "dhammaṃ suṇoti（他听法）；元音脱落等，得 suṇanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3142-9-12", "zh": "suṇosi、suṇotha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3142-13-16", "zh": "suṇomi、suṇoma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3142-17-22", "zh": "用 ṇā 后缀时：suṇāti、suṇanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3142-23-39", "zh": "suṇāsi；根据“kvaci dhātu”等规则变为短音，得 suṇasi；suṇātha、suṇatha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3142-40-43", "zh": "suṇāmi、suṇāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3143-2-16", "zh": "被动语态用 ya 后缀时，根据“kvaci dhātu”等规则变为长音：sūyate、sūyante。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3143-17-20", "zh": "sūyati、sūyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3143-21-27", "zh": "重叠时变为短音：suyyati、suyyanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3143-28-32", "zh": "也可以作 sūyyati、sūyyanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3144-2-5", "zh": "suṇotu、suṇantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3144-6-9", "zh": "suṇohi、suṇotha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3144-10-13", "zh": "suṇomi、suṇoma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3144-14-17", "zh": "suṇātu、suṇantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3144-18-23", "zh": "suṇa、suṇāhi、suṇātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3144-24-27", "zh": "suṇāmi、suṇāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3144-28-32", "zh": "suṇataṃ、suṇantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3144-33-36", "zh": "suṇassu、suṇavho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3144-37-40", "zh": "suṇe、suṇāmase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3144-41-45", "zh": "被动语态：sūyataṃ、sūyantaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3144-46-49", "zh": "sūyatu、sūyantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3145-2-7", "zh": "suṇe、suṇeyya、suṇeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3145-8-11", "zh": "suṇeyyāsi、suṇeyyātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3145-12-15", "zh": "suṇeyyāmi、suṇeyyāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3145-16-19", "zh": "suṇetha、suṇeraṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3145-20-23", "zh": "suṇetho、suṇeyyāvho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3145-24-27", "zh": "suṇeyyaṃ、suṇeyyāmhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3145-28-31", "zh": "sūyetha、sūyeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3146-2-9", "zh": "asuṇi、suṇi、asuṇiṃsu、suṇiṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3146-10-13", "zh": "asuṇi、asuṇittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3146-14-21", "zh": "asuṇiṃ、suṇiṃ、asuṇimha、suṇimha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3146-22-25", "zh": "asuṇittha、suṇittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3146-26-40", "zh": "ṇā 后缀脱落，增强，s 重叠，加上 s 音：assosi、assosiṃsu、paccassosuṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3146-41-44", "zh": "assosi、assosittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3146-45-53", "zh": "assosiṃ、assosimha，也可以作 assosimhā；assosittha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3146-54-57", "zh": "asūyittha、assūyi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-2-7", "zh": "元音脱落等：suṇissati、suṇissanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3147-8-11", "zh": "suṇissasi、suṇissatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-12-15", "zh": "suṇissāmi、suṇissāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-16-19", "zh": "suṇissate、suṇissante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-20-23", "zh": "suṇissase、suṇissavhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-24-27", "zh": "suṇissaṃ、suṇissāmhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-28-35", "zh": "ṇā 后缀脱落，增强：sossati、sossanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3147-36-39", "zh": "sossasi、sossatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-40-43", "zh": "sossāmi、sossāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-44-45", "zh": "sossate。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-46-49", "zh": "sūyissate、sūyissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-50-51", "zh": "asuṇissa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3147-52-54", "zh": "asūyissa，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3148-2-15", "zh": "hi（词根），义为去。前面加 pa，用 ṇā 后缀：pahiṇāti，也可以作 pahiṇati；pahiṇanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3148-16-19", "zh": "pahiṇātu、pahiṇantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3148-20-21", "zh": "pahiṇeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3148-22-26", "zh": "pahiṇi；dūtaṃ pāhesi（他派出使者）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3148-27-28", "zh": "pahiṇissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3148-29-31", "zh": "pahiṇissa，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3149-2-9", "zh": "vu（词根），义为遮蔽：āvuṇāti、āvuṇanti，等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3150-2-21", "zh": "mi（词根），义为投放。根据“kvaci dhātu”等规则，ṇ 变为 n：minoti、minanti，等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3151-2-23", "zh": "apa（词根），义为到达。前面加 pa，元音脱落后根据“dīghaṃ”规则变为长音，用 uṇā 后缀：sampattiṃ pāpuṇāti（他获得成就）、pāpuṇanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3151-24-27", "zh": "pāpuṇāsi、pāpuṇātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3151-28-31", "zh": "pāpuṇāmi、pāpuṇāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3152-2-6", "zh": "被动语态：pāpīyati、pāpīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3152-7-9", "zh": "同样：pāpuṇātu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3152-10-11", "zh": "pāpīyatu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3152-12-15", "zh": "pāpuṇe、pāpuṇeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3152-16-17", "zh": "pāpīyeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3152-18-21", "zh": "pāpuṇi、pāpuṇiṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3152-22-23", "zh": "pāpīyi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3152-24-25", "zh": "pāpuṇissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3152-26-27", "zh": "pāpīyissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3152-28-29", "zh": "pāpuṇissa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3152-30-32", "zh": "pāpīyissa，等等。", "confidence": 90}
